OL,3,GNEWSASuspect charged over death of man
OL,4,Afound injured in hospital car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suspect has been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with the death of a man who
OL,8,Fwas found seriously injured in a
OL,9,Fhospital car park.
OL,11,FThe 21-year-old, who has not been
OL,12,Fnamed, was discovered in the grounds of
OL,13,FNinewells Hospital in Dundee shortly
OL,14,Fafter 03:45 on Sunday.
OL,16,FHe was taken in to the hospital but
OL,17,Fpronounced dead a short time later.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
