OL,3,GNEWSASuspect charged over death of man
OL,4,Afound injured in hospital car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said inquiries had
OL,7,Festablished the man suffered his
OL,8,Finjuries in the Ladyloan area of
OL,9,FArbroath, about 20 miles away, a short
OL,10,Ftime earlier.
